B.WG=new A.bW("smarden-prime","smarden-prime","SmarDen Prime","Smart Building & IoT Automation Platform","A real-time smart-building platform connecting residents, rooms, devices, and automation workflows through a Flutter application with cloud, WebSocket, and hardware-level communication.\n\nSmarDen Prime serves as the command center for modern smart homes and commercial buildings. Engineered with feature-first GetX architecture over a shared service layer, the application manages real-time bidirectional states with sub-50ms latency across diverse device categories.","IoT & Platform",B.bJ,B.Ry,"IoT / Smart Automation",B.K,B.RP,B.OG,B.PR,B.K,B.Wi,B.Wa,"Smart home and building automation environments frequently suffer from fragmented device protocols, erratic cloud latency, brittle local connectivity, and inconsistent multi-brand device onboarding. Users struggle with lagging switch controls, complicated scene configurations, and lack of offline operability when internet connectivity drops.",null,null,"2023 - Present",null,null,null,null,4,"Core Mobile Engineer",B.d3,!1,!1,null,"https://smarden.in/","https://smarden.in/privacy-policy/",u.u,null,null,null,null,null,B.Q2,B.bT)
